# "Another non-Human creature": Venom Connoisseur is a Human Druid, so its entering asks nothing of Bot1 and leaves the Preserver
# alone with the Black Lotus mana unspent in the pool: no trigger goes on the stack (CR 603.2), and the {G} left over is still there.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Forest
Wildborn Preserver
Llanowar Elves
Venom Connoisseur
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Wildborn Preserver.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Wildborn Preserver.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Venom Connoisseur.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot1.Mana = {G}
[T1 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Wildborn Preserver.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Venom Connoisseur.Power = 2
